# Beta 1.1.2: replies for lines the first blind evaluation found the bots could not read.
# New writing (see docs/bot-voices/WRITING-GUIDE.md). {player} is whoever is being answered.

# ---- roleplay: the player spoke in character. Each act gets a reply in kind (Beta 1.1.2, round 2: stock musings didn't fit).
# A greeting is returned, a challenge answered, a question answered as well as a stranger can, a mourning met with respect,
# a toast with a toast; anything else gets an emote. Short, never a lecture.
